          "passageId": "english-pre-a1-m090-reading-passage-01",
          "passage": "Mia visits the doctor with Mum. She feels tired today. She is hungry after school. She is also thirsty. The waiting room is cold. Mum gives her some water. Mia feels sad because she is ill. The doctor talks to Mia. After a rest, she feels better. At home, Mia is happy and well.",
